WEBVTT

00:03:29.314 --> 00:03:31.394
into intergalactic space.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:34.913
And so, what does that
look like -- "typical?"

00:03:34.937 --> 00:03:37.486
What does a "typical" place
in the universe look like?

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:41.520
Well, at enormous expense,
TED has arranged

00:03:41.544 --> 00:03:46.737
a high-resolution immersion
virtual reality rendering

00:03:46.761 --> 00:03:50.086
of the view from intergalactic space.

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:52.954
Can we have the lights off,
please, so we can see it?

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:01.366
Well, not quite, not quite perfect.